{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48990","headline":"甘露寺紫薇花 · 孙鲂","name":"甘露寺紫薇花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀葵鄙下兼全落，菡萏清高且未开。\n赫日迸光飞蝶去，紫薇擎艳出林来。\n闻香不称从僧舍，见影尤思在酒杯。\n谁笑晚芳爲贱劣，便饶春丽已尘埃。\n牵吟过夏惟忧尽，立看移时亦忘回。\n惆怅寓居无好地，嬾能分取一枝栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}